From the source, whether or not your weapon will be unrestricted
is a little more complex than that.  (See gcrownu() in pray.c).

- Long sword is guaranteed to be unrestricted for lawfuls and neutrals,
  broad sword will be unrestricted for chaotics.
- If you are a wizard or monk receiving a spellbook, and did not already
  know the spell, then your wielded weapon will not be unrestricted.
- Otherwise, if you are: 
  A wizard or monk receiving a spellbook, and you already knew the spell,
  Lawful,
  Neutral, and Vorpal Blade does not yet exist,
  Chaotic, and Stormbringer does not yet exist,
  then your wielded weapon will be made blessed, rustproof, at least +1, 
  and will be unrestricted.


